          #FreeFieldQuantumShell.num_remark
            %h6#remark_3 Remark
            %p
              %strong (the “quantum shell”)
            %p
              Beware that, superficially, it might seem that in equation
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:BVDerivationOfSchwingerDyson"} (8)
              not only the term
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                    %mi S
                    %mo ′
                    %mo ,
                    %msup
                      %mi 𝒯
                      %mrow
